#: tabs/energy.c:405
msgid "Ao apertar o botao de energia:"
msgstr "When the power button is pressed:"

#: tabs/energy.c:406
msgid "Tampa e botao de energia"
msgstr "Lid and power button"

#: tabs/energy.c:409
msgid ""
"\"Padrao do sistema\" nao mexe em nada (logind/acpid decidem). Qualquer "
"outra opcao e tratada pelo kiconfd, que tambem impede o logind de agir em "
"duplicidade. A tampa depende do UPower; o botao precisa que o servidor X "
"entregue a tecla de energia."
msgstr ""
"\"System default\" changes nothing (logind/acpid decide). Any other option "
"is handled by kiconfd, which also stops logind from acting a second time. "
"The lid needs UPower; the button needs the X server to deliver the power key."

#: tabs/energy.c:417
msgid "DPMS habilitado"
msgstr "DPMS enabled"

#: tabs/energy.c:438
msgid "Preferir apagar a tela (blank)"
msgstr "Prefer blanking the screen"

#: tabs/energy.c:444
msgid ""
"Fora do horario configurado, a tela volta a temperatura normal. Um horario "
"de desligar menor que o de ligar cruza a meia-noite (ex.: ligar 20:00, "
"desligar 06:00)."
msgstr ""
"Outside the configured schedule, the screen returns to its normal "
"temperature. A turn-off time earlier than the turn-on time crosses midnight "
"(e.g. on at 20:00, off at 06:00)."

